        <h1>Google Ads for Plumbers: Keywords, Campaigns and Better Leads</h1>
        <p class="lf-lede">Google Ads for plumbers work best when campaigns target commercial service intent, send visitors to the right page and measure whether inquiries become legitimate jobs.</p>
